        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:talk#e-c0464cf1e43d2b46",
          "text": "Audio(音频) and video can feel more engaging than text, and so university teachers increasingly turn to these technologies – say, assigning an online talk instead of an article by the same person.",
          "source": {
